   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">למיטב הבנתי זו שכבת אבסטרקציה לפעולות מתימטיות וסטטיסטיות מעל בסיסי נתונים מבוזרות (Hadoop,Spark).</div><div dir=\"rtl\">היא כמדומני מסחרית, ושמעתי עליה דברים טובים אי שם בעבר.</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">מאידך- אם מישהו יודע יותר, אשמח גם אני לדעת.</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">יונתן</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Nov 10, 2016 at 10:23 AM, Amit Fliess <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">0fl...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/H2O_(software)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/H2O_(software)&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496647583000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2UinRjd9fnbTZoUf-rUIgN\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/H2O_(software)</a><span><font color=\"#888888\"><br></font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left\"><br></div></font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-user-group+unsub...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496647583000&amp;usg=AOvVaw289XqRFQO13LIF5ybaKkph\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:small\">--</div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Jonathan Rosenblatt</div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Dept. of Industrial Engineering and Management</div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Ben Gurion University of the Negev</div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><a href=\"http://www.john-ros.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.john-ros.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496647583000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0q1-zT53SPgfXRzb7WX-q7\">www.john-ros.com</a></div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
